# Citation File Format (https://citation-file-format.github.io/). GitHub reads
# this and shows a "Cite this repository" button on the repo page.
#
# It must agree with backend/app/citation.py, which is what the platform's own
# Cite dialog serves. backend/tests/test_citation.py fails if the two drift.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this platform in research, please cite it and the CCR method papers below."
type: software
title: "CCR Platform: Theory-Driven Psychological Text Analysis with Contextualized Construct Representation"
abstract: >-
  A web platform for Contextualized Construct Representation (CCR): upload a
  corpus, choose validated psychological scale items, embed items and texts
  locally, and score every text by cosine similarity, with per-run metadata and
  a script that reproduces the numbers offline.
